WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.190
Ten days.
A different visibility leader.

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.650
On November fifth,

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.130
Branch appeared in eleven of twelve
office chair answers.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:09.670
On November fifteenth,

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.630
Steelcase led with ten of twelve.

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:15.810
But most mentioned still doesn't
mean unanimous first choice.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:18.110
ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:19.910
ranked Steelcase first.

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.750
Claude ranked Herman Miller first.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.690
Each snapshot captured
twelve usable answers

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.930
across four AI assistants
and three prompt types.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:31.730
Branch still appeared in all four
under-four-hundred-dollar answers.

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:33.810
These are captured snapshots,

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:35.610
not product-quality ratings.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:37.570
Model and privacy settings changed,

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.650
so this isn't a controlled trend test.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:44.300
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
